## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end understanding of an AWS-based AI data flow, including extraction, NLP, storage, and indexing, plus privacy and cost controls.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven design with S3, Lambda, Textract, Comprehend, DynamoDB
- IAM least privilege and KMS encryption
- Observability: DLQ, retries, CloudWatch
- Data governance: PII detection, versioning guidance

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Lambda handler sketch
exports.handler = async (evt) => {
  const s3Key = evt.Records[0].s3.object.key;
  const text = await textract.extractText(s3Key);
  const topics = await comprehend.classify(text);
  const pii = comprehend.detectPII(text);
  await s3.writeJSON(text, s3Key.replace('input','output'));
  await dynamo.upsert({ designId, s3Key, transcriptKey: '...', topics, piiFlag: pii > 0, timestamp: Date.now()});
}
```

